          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>Strategic Recommendations</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>Roll-out Status</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>: A full rollout is </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>not supported</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'> yet due to the missed 5% threshold.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>Iterative Approach</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>: We suggest a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>phased implementation</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'> to fix friction points before a full launch.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>Learning Curve</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>: Future analysis will track </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>all client sessions</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'> to see if usability improves over time.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>Wealth Insights</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>: We will investigate </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>account balance significance</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'> to better serve affluent clients.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>Confirm Stage Fix</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>: We must simplify the final step to reduce high review times and abandonment.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
