          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Overall Design</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>The A/B test design was robust in terms of sample size, duration, and test type; however, there are opportunities for further refinement.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='49530' id='158' type-v2='text' w='52600' x='7437' y='31223'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Key Observations &amp; Pain Points</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Lack of Guidance:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'> missing instructions on how to navigate the new platform. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Step 3 Friction:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'> shows the highest difficulty level (high error and drop-out rates). </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Duplicate Entries:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'> Clients were able to initiate the process multiple times.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Data Gaps (Gender Analysis):</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>  optional or missing.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Drop-off Sentiment:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'> If a user drops off at Step 3, trigger a micro-survey: </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20' italic='true'>&quot;Why are you leaving?&quot;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi' fontsize='20'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
